<title>POLAND: SLASKI NOV NET RISES TO PLN 19.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>SLASKI NOV NET RISES TO PLN 19.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					 19.54 vs    14.07</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   29.57 vs    24.72</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 65.78 vs    75.60</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     111.96 vs   110.79</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					297.48 vs   276.15</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  426.84 vs   390.40</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		735.86 vs   646.38</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues   1,258.91 vs 1,034.88</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Slaski SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
